#: scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4ff18c81ef58fb3f2de5cdb76082cba68526f9fdc96fec5c62b09d9b8e174c1
#. default-sha256: 46a0d9a8f590e5656c04cd6370f395d719429c7d60ea59c856024de41511bbe5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Come over here, "
"Giselle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Venha aqui, "
"Giselle."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f05fb0e9101ae4b5425593566192e0a91b5c9fc588d93ee2ee12f548f26c04f
#. default-sha256: a520fe701e2ea074e9eca15ac98d0c297edade4746dc8399ebf46b6b12b7c96d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫O... ⟪k:1⟫Okay... ⟪k:2⟫Um, ⟪k:3⟫may I ask why you asked me here so late at night, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫T... ⟪k:1⟫Tá bem... ⟪k:2⟫Hum, ⟪k:3⟫posso perguntar por que você me chamou aqui tão tarde da "
"noite, Mestre?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8358594aa08344003b404108c41724fc119363987907a364e3840e0afb4b3ad6
#. default-sha256: 800057f370e6e40a66c712b9c19490e9d1eb11f4d354b3ec731980e6cb446a4d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, I just wanted to have a little chat.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Care for some wine? ⟪k:3⟫Come closer, and "
"I’ll pour you a glass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, eu só queria bater um papo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Deseja um pouco de vinho? ⟪k:3⟫Aproxime-se e eu lhe "
"servirei um copo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 599f2beaa25a298e7111a61dbb59de9211b7e2b43b8c30c433356995e678d666
#. default-sha256: d5e1342dd554ee0137a2030e7fd5f93b5c1f28cbc9401666e32c42a1e07e779e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had this wine imported from up north.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They use very hard water, and like it "
"rather tart,⟪k:3⟫so it leaves quite the lasting impression on your tongue."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu consegui esse vinho importado do norte.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eles usam água mineral, e gostam "
"bastante azedo,⟪k:3⟫por isso deixa uma impressão duradoura em sua língua."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4f4829b9faa9ab7b501a0fc209228d2ac78bd463b171ce4b258985c07f9489e
#. default-sha256: 7becb0a20580ba426ab5b564e5d42935756fbdb459640b919e27ad34c42323f8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And yet, it goes down so easily, you just can’t seem to stop.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What do you say? Have "
"a sip."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E, ainda assim, desce tão facilmente, você simplesmente não consegue parar.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫O que "
"acha? Tome um gole."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76d44dfd577af3b978d6a255765d5bffaf2821a233adad33544b24331fcf3a32
#. default-sha256: 30203323501fad1201e89777ec1fd1970881c39c492b6f648cdd886968e7ebeb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or does your expertise as a trader allow you to evaluate a wine’s quality without tasting it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ou sua experiência como negociante permite avaliar a qualidade de um vinho sem degustá-lo?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 365e5e41562dc40c82602a267ea19148c668aefd12f63c412bef36341762e619
#. default-sha256: bc98fdeeb170a44648a735fabbcfd808407e68b278ab1ed421cf91cebf49be35
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫but... ⟪k:3⟫um..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫Não... ⟪k:2⟫mas... ⟪k:3⟫hum..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a0e3a13abfa498ff152ee2410057bdbe5c65f02b05542112ad556189893a28b
#. default-sha256: 561072cc100a83fab9cde98457a0dae3bac2c95728a3cd01bafd474f37c8668d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, Giselle, don’t trample all over my good graces."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Por favor, Giselle, não ignore minhas boas graças."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b09699e8bba6d48b9cec442c7d47c640e740ff1d9bbcc62fa7dfa1d16644355
#. default-sha256: e3963172a3e0d4d64db87471d2edd086757f5e63a93c1d752ed13512bb3c419a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Very well then... ⟪k:1⟫I will have a sip, Master, but no more..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Muito bem então... ⟪k:1⟫Eu vou tomar um gole, Mestre, mas nada mais..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba5c73dcbad2df915bf796a7e55ce21283efdb600ef73ed087f987f6d1636bae
#. default-sha256: d8923bb2f316546f3c591f9295d917cdd336bafcef01caead672d28d2b511bf5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Have you ever considered growing out your hair?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Já pensou em deixar o cabelo crescer?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33d871ae70c6b8b59dace1b63a9445ac0461c124483053b3e6aeeafb86d8d8e7
#. default-sha256: d8ace0f476ffda2d9506c25e1f998c636dce063975aaab90cede799eb6e8c62e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Having long hair made it difficult to do my job..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ter cabelo comprido dificulta meu trabalho..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 684525d51f09d0cea032c3e7e02038e2f7e723befef767a783a8404d474d7b9f
#. default-sha256: 5d7d0e26261b1e2eb3f9779026b7ad140e241e15937b22384179afb4bbc1e12e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re not a merchant anymore, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You deserve to look like the woman you truly "
"are."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você não é mais uma comerciante, no entanto.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Merece se parecer com a mulher que "
"realmente é."

#: scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46c2e89de119363b5a071817ba4d1075d9939572cc40ca3f9455bf4e94994ab2
#. default-sha256: 1958db240c4a3680dcc3f214959f17911e56dab7224a35834e077d99544b633e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I have no doubt longer hair would accentuate your natural beauty.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a gorgeous "
"shade of black, so deep a man could get lost in it for years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não tenho dúvidas de que um cabelo mais comprido acentuaria sua beleza natural.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫É "
"um lindo tom de preto, tão profundo que um homem poderia se perder nele por anos."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5264834716e7225f916e979fdf4ad61078fb432327e94c0f381ae1c0b08212bd
#. default-sha256: 807c02e438dc00df2136a9ee989cec21e577a81f82c82a247c49f91b4a86b88a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would contrast the color of your skin fabulously.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Highlight your eyes, your "
"cheekbones, your nape, your shoulders, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and your chest..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Isso contrastaria fabulosamente com a cor da sua pele.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Destacaria seus olhos, suas "
"maçãs do rosto, sua nuca, seus ombros, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e seu peito..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c8696293b2389b1881fc78e3078301aa797aa318eb9e6274c33bf1bffd19b48
#. default-sha256: fc443668f295a2f137424b15b0b5716be9ec49270b2be8db372eec23416127a8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Um, I— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I should get going..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hum, eu— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫eu devia ir..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c93948109a9d3de9fa487b878aed03d925ef2ae406600c3af3b3f175ec924703
#. default-sha256: 2b9202c553433778001c869d6a4f06423a20a7b34d78357e981f0af6d0f2d18d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, but we’re not done talking yet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ah, mas ainda não terminamos de conversar."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56de8644e35bfb3d932297e5cdef18846cd968075fee0ee08a697b72eed62da9
#. default-sha256: 5e3f03948cd8129fcbf6112811a853affb8dd8f15901dc42f94181e673fffdc8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I... ⟪k:1⟫I would not want a lack of sleep to interfere with my ability to work tomorrow. "
"⟪k:2⟫Thank you very much for the wine. It was delicio—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu... ⟪k:1⟫Eu não gostaria que a falta de sono interferisse na minha capacidade de trabalhar "
"amanhã. ⟪k:2⟫Muito obrigado pelo vinho. Estava delicio—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5704f3552f9cc95cf9fa7203bd8ed9dc71ffc319b2942b7b9d7118e5a26d8590
#. default-sha256: d0a3352b4c1ac39e944cbba3bae8b7b50614717262b6f3b58eab5a99816b7be0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫—?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫—?!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b6ca4f1caff73fb3c4ba53455198f089381a0d1e680a112081edf2ce61694ba
#. default-sha256: 118c34c5828192b362d45aad03823c7650e54299c7d517e519088ea247237577
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so cold-hearted, now.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From the moment I first laid eyes on you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não há necessidade de ser tão fria, vamos.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Desde o primeiro momento em que pus os "
"olhos em você..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9cdd0d5140c125a8e466ddf5d1f3ba0e75044e4bb036624d837d9cf7dd583e14
#. default-sha256: cd984e8b3e186982911b1dd266a343a42900c8ebcf690ee7adceb6ed848ab356
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫M— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Master!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Th-⟪k:5⟫That’s enough fooling around for one night!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫M— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mestre!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫J-⟪k:5⟫Já chega de brincadeiras por uma noite!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd8338e369bc986c76b189659e5264a5c057a33154331552573eb649c0c81023
#. default-sha256: 77583f87ad9f571d9fb009543c7c2fdf8af2a783ca53c918e3488173af78403c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, now, don’t be afraid.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wouldn’t do anything to hurt you.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I simply "
"want to express my love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vamos, vamos, não tenha medo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu não faria nada para machucá-la.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu "
"simplesmente quero expressar meu amor."

#: scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a1a0671074c4566fe32f8cbd1920b59dfc7ed8d552c46bd96eb2fc93bb37a26
#. default-sha256: b89609cab61523c1a6e3b26e9b323517847df989aa69311363a0e1e15cd0fe49
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫L— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Let go of me!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I-I only came here to work, nothing more!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫S— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Solte-me!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫E-Eu só vim aqui para trabalhar, nada mais!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9A2A3510_0093_4303_878F_376E620EF135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27153dc018e8265d8a830cc6a269d8ae30073d841f4a0dd513268077b511cecf
#. default-sha256: cc9b1ed17037ad09bf651fae904cae52c665dcbb8aca529fd625d87b026dd749
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9A2A3510_0093_4303_878F_376E620EF135"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The first time I saw you, I thought it would be a tragic waste to leave you to wither away "
"working at some little street-side shop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A primeira vez que te vi, pensei que seria um trágico desperdício deixá-la definhando "
"trabalhando em alguma lojinha de rua."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F3005EFA_444A_4354_A225_921F01A37502
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be683b9928c14bb4c15d1831584bf5940bf197d94ca1e6824d1f6a71e81b1d96
#. default-sha256: 9586c047dc8bd65226702069debeaff8f499221f6eee4ea89eb2adc0b46d17f1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F3005EFA_444A_4354_A225_921F01A37502"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Stop—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pare—!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_46E28852_C5E3_4052_B683_A1257437AB7D
