"⟪k:0⟫Someone! Anyone! Restrain this girl! She’s a demon!⟪k:1⟫A devil! Tie her up and hand her "
"over to the clergy!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Alguém! Qualquer um! Contenha essa garota! Ela é um demônio!⟪k:1⟫Um diabo! Amarre-a e "
"entregue-a ao clero!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0DB1E3A0_48EF_49AE_80A0_7CE8AFFC26C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
